option.aperture.comment =
option.DoF_Adaptation_Speed.comment = §bWhat is this?§r This controls how quickly auto focus adjusts to where you are looking.
option.FAR_BLUR_ONLY.comment = §bWhat is this?§r make it such that it cannot do an unfocus blur on objects near you, only objects far away.
option.REMOVE_HAND_BLUR.comment = §bWhat is this?§r remove all blurring on your hand.
option.DOF_DISPERSION_MULT.comment = §bWhat is this?§r This adds a color offset for red and blue, for a cool effect.